Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别害怕黑暗  开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid of the dark? What, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然该害怕黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you should be afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你不知道外面有什么  -是牙仙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what's out there. - It was the tooth fairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-爱尔兰小妖  -为何一定要是小丑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A leprechaun. - Why did it have to be clowns?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.71,0:00:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一堆小精灵在帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say you have a bunch of elves working for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仙女  得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairies? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是丘比特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Cupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.64,0:00:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那是发着光的热乎乎的  -乳头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a little glowing hot... - Nipples?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-裸女  -太让人不安了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ...Naked lady. - Well, that's super disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前从没见过婴儿怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a baby monster before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这么不愿相信上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it so hard to believe that God
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.82,0:00:29.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在让我看到一些关于黑暗的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be sending me visions about the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.03,0:00:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟想告诉我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望上帝  指望我们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't count on god. Okay? Count on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是上帝  那么他给我看的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is God, then he's showing me something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.36,0:00:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办  是笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do with -- the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.91,0:00:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-路西法的笼子  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucifer's cage? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他是告诉我  我必须回去怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he's telling me I have to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.33,0:00:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(威斯康辛州  梅诺莫尼)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一勺糖还是两勺\N{\fnArial\fs30}One spoonful of sugar or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.35,0:01:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦迪  我和爸爸准备去吃饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maddie, daddy and I are ready to go to dinner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你准备好了  告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whenever you're ready, you just let us know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.56,0:01:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮和我还没喝完茶呢  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparkle and me aren't done with tea, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那等你准备好了告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...When you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有预定呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have reservations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,育儿手册上说要耐心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The R.I.E. manual says be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就等着她和假想朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now we wait for her to have fake tea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝完一顿假想的茶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with her fake imaginary friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.09,0:01:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一直玩下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can party forever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让妈妈和爸爸吃麦圈当晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}while mommy and daddy eat cheerios for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.23,0:01:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  麦迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool, Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你爸爸妈妈去吧  我来收拾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with your mom and dad. I'll clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你  亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:35.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Maddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是麦...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Mad--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘记刷牙  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to brush your teeth, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.46,0:02:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.47,0:04:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:19.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.61,0:04:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sully!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.77,0:04:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了所有你最喜欢的零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I made all your favorite snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们原来是好朋友  最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were friends. Like, best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨利  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sully. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  你不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.96,0:04:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么能揍我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you punch me... then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟谁说话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你中风了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you having a stroke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能闻到吐司味儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you smell toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:04:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我想  他看不到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't see me unless I want him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这都是什么破烂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all of this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候开始吃这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When'd you start eating this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是粟米脆饼配棉花糖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that marshmallows on nachos?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.14,0:05:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你能看到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. C-can you see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这应该是萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is...Sully,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}m-my friend from when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说这个吊裤带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean Mork from Ork here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的二逼幻想朋友萨利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is your dumbass imaginary friend Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不二  也不逼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dumb or ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这幻想朋友的幻想朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean your imaginary imaginary friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.84,0:05:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  "幻想朋友"只是个描述性术语\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off, "imaginary friend" is more of a descriptive term.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你刚刚说的方式  很冒犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you just said it? That was a little...offensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.03,0:05:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.74,0:05:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其次  我们是赞纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secondly, we're Zanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:00.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和被害人都是赞纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and the victim were Zanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮助孩子  我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We help kids. We're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  告诉他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.37,0:06:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我还有点没从你是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm still trying to wrap my head around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.61,0:06:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个震惊中缓过来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}this whole you being real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  当然了  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, no, of course. No, that's okay. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这的确出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all really unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.25,0:06:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  可以这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's one word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是猎人  这是你们的工作  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're hunters. That's what you do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是帮助他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you help people, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他"人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不在这个范畴内\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托鬼  你开什么玩笑  看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on? Are you kidding... look...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这...我去...\N{\fnArial\fs30}This... mother--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.22,0:06:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  图书馆  现在去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, library, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.64,0:06:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我就待这儿好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, I'll just stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coolio.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是真信他那套吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not actually buying this crap, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我9岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, when I was 9 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我最想要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what I wanted more than anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,棉花糖粟米脆饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshmallow nachos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你小时候很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you were a weird-ass kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来只跟一个人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only person I ever told about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.05,0:07:21.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-就是萨利  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sully?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, man. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许  这是你的幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know, maybe this is just one of your visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们都能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, except we're both seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且跟笼子  路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it doesn't involve the cage or Lucifer
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是我去跟笼子里的路西法说话无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}or me having to talk to Lucifer in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊  这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗马尼亚传说中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Romanian lore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赞纳是指引保护迷失儿童的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zanna are creatures who guide and protect lost children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.43,0:07:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赞纳有意显现为孩子的臆想之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zanna intentionally appear as figments of a child's imagination,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等孩子不再需要指引时\N{\fnArial\fs30}allowing the child to move on with confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们便让孩子自信地继续生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}once guidance is no longer necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许萨利说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Sully's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.28,0:07:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就算那个笨蛋是真的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, say bozo is legit. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.83,0:07:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然疯狂  但是好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, you know... hello, crazytown, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.19,0:08:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这怎么跟我们有关了  -因为有人死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How is this our problem? - Because someone's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  是个生物死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, something is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.97,0:08:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仙女教母被人杀了  跟我们无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fairy godmother getting capped? That ain't our beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.23,0:08:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是  我知道  迪恩  但是  -但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, I know that, Dean, but... - But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  虽然听上去很诡异很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as messed up and insane as this sounds...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利帮过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面可可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a horror show in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.71,0:08:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  你进去过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, you've been inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是管理层了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in management now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以平时不怎么出外勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't get out in the field much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来见亮亮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came to see Sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sp-- Sparkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I show up and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果那里一片狼藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the place was bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子报了警  妈妈吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid had called the cops, mom's freaking out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...Sparkle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.65,0:08:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  由于赞纳的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so according to Zanna rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:09:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有孩子看到了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the kid is the only witness, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们里面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你想怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, what are you thinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  扮成伯特和厄尼  太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. The Bert and Ernie pretext. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  你不用非得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you didn't have to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这幻想朋友什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this whole imaginary friend thing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当年很蠢  现在也很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}was dumb then and it's dumb now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你已经说得很明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you've made that pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就没想过要告诉我他是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think to tell me that he was real?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我没以为他是真的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, I didn't think he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也看到传说书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you saw the lore book, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我9岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe when I was 9 years old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他是真的  但我长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was real, but I grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者过了那个阶段了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or grew out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  我放下了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. I left it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会需要那熊玩意啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you need Drop Dead Fred for in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候很孤独的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of a lonely kid, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才不孤独呢  你还有我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't lonely. You had me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接啊  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.45,0:10:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  都没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever happens, it's cool beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你问了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  你说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.93,0:10:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过会问  但爸爸说不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I said I would ask. Dad said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.06,0:10:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.29,0:10:25.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有练习射击  我能跑两英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've been shooting. I can run 2 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.19,0:10:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道银能杀狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know silver kills werewolves, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy... - No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.24,0:10:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你比我还小时就开始猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started hunting when you were younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没有幻想朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I never had an imaginary friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我听到了  -我会继续磨老爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I heard that. - Look, I'll keep working on dad, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别听他的  萨姆  他坏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't listen to him, Sammy. He's a germ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.91,0:10:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许下次你可以跟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now maybe you can come next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我得挂了  过几天打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I gotta go. Call you in a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.75,0:10:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, I'll just be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}...here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们终于可以拿瓶子做火箭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. We can finally make those bottle rockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.46,0:11:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-有事吗  -伯曼太太  我是斯特拉莫医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I help you? - Mrs. Berman, I'm Dr. Strummer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-这位是我的同事  -麦克高文医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is my associate... - Dr. MacGowan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是儿童福利机构的创伤咨询师\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are trauma counselors with child services.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来跟进昨天的一宗报警的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to follow up on a police report filed yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请进吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.53,0:11:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿  麦迪  是她报了警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my daughter, Maddie, she's the one who called.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.30,0:11:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的想象力很丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she has an active imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她幻想出了一个独角兽男人  亮亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made up this unicorn man, Sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.05,0:11:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她觉得他死在她房间里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, she thinks he's dead in her room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮是个独角兽还男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Sparkle is a unicorn and also a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:48.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-嗯  -独角男喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - So a manicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以...\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-当然  请  谢谢  -好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, please. Thank you. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.30,0:12:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,麦迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.49,0:12:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和我搭档想问问你昨晚的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}My partner and I would like to ask you about last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于亮亮的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Sparkle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈说你不想回你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom says you don't wanna go back into your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还是个婴儿时就睡这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been her room since she was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.71,0:12:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一直喜欢这个房间  直到昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's loved this room. And then last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,介意我们到处看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we take a look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好吧  问题在哪  -不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. What's the problem? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都说很惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it was horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能让我们看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind enlightening us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.15,0:13:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我让你们看到我们能看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I show you all we can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.53,0:13:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可不许说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't tell a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  妹子最喜欢听男人说什么幻想朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, 'cause chicks dig the whole imaginary friend thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  那孩子绝逼需要心理医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. That kid is gonna need all the shrinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.12,0:13:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  他的血也是亮的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. So his... blood is glittery?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.85,0:13:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就连死后  亮亮都还如此闪亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when he's dead, Sparkle can't stop shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.91,0:13:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会做这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是刀捅死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利  赞纳间互相能看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully, can Zanna see other Zanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.59,0:13:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不会像你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赞纳是干不出这种事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Zanna could never do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么可看的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to see, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.01,0:14:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always under the impression
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父母该尽量让孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it was parent's job to let a child be a child
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-保持童心  -这下不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- as long as possible. - Oh, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们太纵容她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we let her get too carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫亮亮的幻想朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}an imaginary friend named Sparkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多可爱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's cuter than that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这下跟我女儿一样小题大做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being as dramatic as my daughter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她脸上都沾上了  萨姆  她脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, it's on her face. Sam, it's on her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.42,0:14:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-告诉我  -她脸上沾了亮亮的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell me. - She's got Sparkle on her face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么唤回我们的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get our girl back?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁说句话啊  谁赶紧说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's say something. Someone's gotta say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  你们有客房吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Is there a spare bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.54,0:14:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  或许该让麦迪住那儿  会好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Uh, maybe Maddie can sleep there. That should help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.06,0:14:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她脸上有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on her face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热水澡  对人大有益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a hot shower does wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好洗洗  净化一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real deep scrub. Purify.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-麦迪吗  -一家人都需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For Maddie? - The whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起去洗洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just get the whole gang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.85,0:14:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起洗澡的家庭...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the family that showers together...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.76,0:15:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-住口  别说了  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull up! Pull up. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧  先从这里开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Why... why don't you start there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.72,0:15:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果需要更多指引可以联系我们办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can contact our office for more guidance if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  佐伊  我好像也看到宝藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my gosh, Zoe, I think I saw the treasure, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不是还得练体操吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But wait, don't you have gymnastics?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  等我回来再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Let's look at it when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妮琪昨晚没向总部报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Nicky didn't check in with the home office last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们还能跟彼此说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gazoos can talk to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们赞纳有心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us zanna share a telepathic link.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.59,0:16:39.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会在那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:48.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然是美人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A frickin' mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简直是屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bloodbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  哭出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just let it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得为萨姆坚强一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta stay strong for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来又是捅死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like more stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  萨利  会有什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Sully, is there anybody
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想伤害妮琪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would want to hurt, uh, Nicky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  不过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.93,0:17:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她男友有点黏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, I mean, her boyfriend's a little clingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我最好的朋友之一啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's one of my best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  维慕斯绝不会伤害妮琪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, Weems would never hurt Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他太爱她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he loved her too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太过也不是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, too much ain't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找美人鱼的男友谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's go talk to the mermaid's boyfriend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.57,0:17:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幻想朋友还有男朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because apparently, imaginary friends have boyfriends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能把她丢这儿  会吓到孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just leave her here. It's disturbing for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你要我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找个大马桶把她冲走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find a giant toilet and flush it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你希望我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like us to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚好像看到铁锹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I saw some shovels back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,龙猫还真在乎你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Totoro really cares for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我想到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.43,0:18:15.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风很大的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, on really windy days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.13,0:18:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你呢  -我以前想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? - I used to,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.07,0:18:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我摔断了胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I broke my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.55,0:18:26.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-该你了  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your turn. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以一下吃掉十个华夫饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you could eat 10 waffles in one sitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望等我长大了可以  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hope so when I'm big. Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried, once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起来太快头晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.97,0:18:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}about running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃离你吗  绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}From you? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我是指  逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I mean, from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猎人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hunting life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你想去学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe you wanna go to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交些朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make some friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有一天我就会不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one day you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我需要你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I want you to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.17,0:19:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以成为你想做的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be whatever you wanna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.09,0:19:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是迪恩  你不是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Dean. You're not your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且萨姆好棒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam is so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象吗  离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine? Running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad would kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的选择  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的人生  这都要看你的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your life. I mean, it's all up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懒鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, slacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我一个人埋了小美人鱼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I burying Ariel by myself here or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  嗯  -快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Yeah, of course. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up, Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.74,0:20:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.69,0:20:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人人都有尿尿的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's got a pee-pee problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.21,0:20:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维慕斯会处理好这些床单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weems will take care of these sheets,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.83,0:21:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈绝不会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mommy will be none the wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果妈妈听到了我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if mommy hears us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,弗莱彻  今晚就是有游行妈妈都不会醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fletcher, not even a parade can wake mommy up tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.88,0:21:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她喝了大人果汁睡过去了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she drank her grown-up juice and went sleepy-by?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.36,0:21:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  妈妈今晚喝了好多果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Mommy drank a lot of juice tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想去睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you wanna try and hit the sack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们上面见了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll catch you on the flip side, okay, bud?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  维慕斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Weems.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.43,0:22:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sul--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维慕斯  维慕斯  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Weems! Weems, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.95,0:23:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.81,0:23:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刀扎透了我的腰间赘肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went right through my love handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的肥肉救了我  能相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My fat saved me. Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-肥肉最棒了  -嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fat is the best. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.20,0:23:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美人鱼就没那么幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the mermaid wasn't so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.56,0:23:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在跟我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.75,0:23:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.50,0:23:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.12,0:24:03.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维慕斯  你最后见到美人鱼妮琪是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Weems, when was the last time you saw Nicky the mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.28,0:24:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  真不敢相信我刚刚说了那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I can't believe I just said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.95,0:24:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.52,0:24:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妮琪怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Nicky?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.63,0:24:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.66,0:24:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.57,0:24:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维慕斯  我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weems, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.77,0:24:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  她是...我的女人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! She... she was my girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.72,0:24:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亮亮也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparkle's gone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.30,0:24:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧  哥们  我们被灭团了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sparkle! Dude, that's, like, our whole posse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.66,0:24:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你没事啊  你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hey, you're okay. You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.51,0:24:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你们都是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right, so you're all pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.78,0:24:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人会跟你们有仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anybody who would have beef with the bunch of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.36,0:24:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen her before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.11,0:24:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你看到人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. You saw somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.40,0:24:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她捅了我之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After she...shivved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.39,0:24:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开着一辆老大众甲壳虫跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she took off in an old VW bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.71,0:24:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我真难过  维慕斯  -这是好事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry, Weems.  - So this is a good thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.63,0:24:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-不  这太棒了  -好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, no, this is a great thing. I mean, - It's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.46,0:24:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,独角男  美人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}a manicorn? A freakin' mermaid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这叫我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.06,0:24:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但开车的小妞  这是本行  我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a chick in a car? That's terra firma. I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.79,0:24:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你去  我照顾他俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you go. I'll, uh, cover these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.25,0:25:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  直接穿透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It goes... it's... yeah, it goes all the way through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.34,0:25:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.39,0:25:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酸洗牛仔裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, acid wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so special about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.07,0:25:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美人鱼喜欢我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mermaids dig me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.16,0:25:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  孩子为什么喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I mean, why do kids like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.79,0:25:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会弹幻想吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I play air guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.05,0:25:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弹幻想吉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play air guitar?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.09,0:25:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆也弹幻想吉他  我也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam plays air guitar. I can play air guitar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.36,0:25:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.09,0:25:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-独奏真棒  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good solo. Good solo. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.04,0:26:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还是比不上克莱普顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's no Clapton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.11,0:26:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去弄点绷带  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm gonna go get some bandages. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.51,0:26:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就回来  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'll be right back, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.25,0:26:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.92,0:26:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个萨姆吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not that Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.01,0:26:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利的萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大概是吧  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I would be. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨利现在又在一起了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you and Sully are, like, back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你多大了  -不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old are you? - Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.99,0:26:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.99,0:26:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们时不时都需要调整下心情  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need a tune-up from time to time. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的  他来找我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He, uh, came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.12,0:26:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是在帮他忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm helping him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.32,0:26:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.41,0:26:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你伤透了他的心  哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke his heart, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.00,0:27:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好上路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to hit the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我爸爸刚打来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. My dad just called.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -他改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - He changed his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要我一起去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me to come with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去猎魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a... on a hunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.56,0:27:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,终于啊  他觉得我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally! He thinks I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.41,0:27:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得赶下一趟大巴去密尔沃基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to catch the next bus to Milwaukee.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.83,0:27:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想要这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.21,0:27:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是温家人  我是猎魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Winchester. I hunt monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.37,0:27:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会想要别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I want anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.41,0:27:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这未必适合你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I-I'm not sure it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不能替我开心呢  萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you be happy for me, Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.71,0:27:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是担心你在走上一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just afraid you're going down a path
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.84,0:27:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不该走的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might be better off not going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.86,0:27:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.77,0:27:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.86,0:27:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我见过的最勇敢的孩子之一了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of the bravest kids I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是...猎魔什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just... This whole hunting thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.47,0:27:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并不是唯一的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, it's not the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.36,0:27:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有很多其他出路  你能找到一条的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many other ways. And you can find one, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.21,0:27:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.89,0:27:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想走别的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.45,0:28:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟爸爸和迪恩在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be with my dad and... and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.99,0:28:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这么说只是因为我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying this 'cause I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.88,0:28:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假想朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretend friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.72,0:28:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.32,0:28:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你需要我  我都在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm... I'm here as long as you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.37,0:28:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不需要你了  萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you anymore, Sully.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.28,0:28:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道我当初为什么要想象你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know why I made you up in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could unmake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.35,0:28:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If -- if that -- if that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.71,0:28:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.05,0:28:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你度过美好长寿的一生  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a good, long life, sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.65,0:29:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.97,0:29:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-紧吗  -不紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it too tight? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.17,0:29:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.38,0:29:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  可以了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. There you go, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.30,0:29:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.93,0:29:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去看看弗莱彻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check on Fletcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.29,0:29:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子老憋不住尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid has a bladder like a sieve.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.43,0:29:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's... pretty awesome,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.76,0:29:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样帮助你身边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you help everyone around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.19,0:29:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候结果并不好  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't always work out, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.10,0:29:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.93,0:29:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很过意不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当年分别时的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how we left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.55,0:29:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我当时还是个熊孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I was a kid. I was a-a jerk kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.97,0:29:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当时是想帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- and you were trying to help, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.02,0:29:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.85,0:30:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们总是要分别的  而我们的离别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, goodbyes are part of the job, and ours was...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.94,0:30:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It was really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm not gonna lie to ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.96,0:30:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跑去猎魔时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you went off to hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.27,0:30:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把那当做我最大的失败之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I considered that one of my biggest failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.33,0:30:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时真的觉得你想过别的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just seemed so clear to me that you wanted something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.71,0:30:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我想错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.13,0:30:34.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这不做得挺好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it all worked out, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.30,0:30:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒未必\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.28,0:30:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.27,0:30:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.99,0:30:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.88,0:30:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直关注着我的小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep track of my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的很棒  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you did really good, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.71,0:30:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不都好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...not all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:56.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也做过些不好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.37,0:31:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有些非常不好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And some really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.44,0:31:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.62,0:31:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把一样东西给放了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let something out into the world that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.31,0:31:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.25,0:31:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别人是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the others are calling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.88,0:31:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到了一些流言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just heard rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.90,0:31:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会弥补的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna fix it. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.07,0:31:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩和我  我们会想办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean and I, we're -- we're -- we're gonna fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.32,0:31:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.08,0:31:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.48,0:31:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得上帝想帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think God wants to help us fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.00,0:31:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.02,0:31:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我做不到他要求我做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can do what he's asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.23,0:31:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱里有个笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this cage in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's where they keep lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.58,0:31:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.51,0:32:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.01,0:32:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝好像想让我回到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think god wants me to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.26,0:32:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.58,0:32:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,逃离这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}about running away anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.87,0:32:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想过  不  我曾经想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. Um, I mean, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.30,0:32:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但好久没这样想了  现在不想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not in a while. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(找到她了  乔治大街1534号见  带上萨利)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.74,0:32:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.72,0:33:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偷一辆面包车\N{\fnArial\fs30}about hot-wiring a minivan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.73,0:33:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梦里想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.69,0:33:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.80,0:33:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(就来)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.85,0:33:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟正在赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.23,0:33:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.94,0:34:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们似乎都认识同一个幻想朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we have a mutual imaginary friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认识萨利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.13,0:34:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.37,0:34:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.81,0:34:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.07,0:34:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把萨利交给我  我就把哥哥还你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me sully, I give you your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.39,0:34:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要对萨利做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want with sully?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.73,0:34:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他杀了我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who killed my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.82,0:34:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.15,0:34:57.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞茜和她的双胞胎姐姐  是我以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese and her twin sister, they were my first kids
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.18,0:34:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你搞砸之后  接触的第一对孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I thought I screwed things up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-那么是他的错吗  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So this is his fault? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.80,0:35:04.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  瑞茜  是我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Reese, I'm the one that bungled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.76,0:35:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.68,0:35:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不该让她追着我到马路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should never have let her chase me into the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.52,0:35:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来只是在玩捉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just playing tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.21,0:35:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我为什么没看到有车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why I didn't see the car coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.79,0:35:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我再也不想出外勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I never went back in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.17,0:35:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也没去找别的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I never found another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.49,0:35:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我太害怕自己会伤到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was too scared I'd hurt 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.25,0:35:27.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你给我带来多少痛苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know how bad you messed me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.81,0:35:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"奥德丽死了  都是因为隐形人"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Audrey's dead because of the invisible man."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.89,0:35:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你试试对十个不同的儿童心理医生说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try telling that to about 10 different kiddie shrinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.31,0:35:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想知道萨利是不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wondered if Sully was real,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.04,0:35:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我迷上了民间传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I got obsessed with folklore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.62,0:35:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我出国去罗马尼亚学习  然后我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I studied abroad in Romania, and then I found out
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.06,0:35:48.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是赞纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's a Zanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.65,0:35:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  赞纳都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and Zanna are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.07,0:35:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女巫也是这么告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the witch tried to tell me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.28,0:35:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-女巫  -她卖给我一个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The witch? - She sold me a spell
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我就能够看到这些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that I'd be able to see these freaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.43,0:36:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还给了我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave me this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于能从这些怪物手上救下其他孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, I can save other kids from these monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.86,0:36:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了我的朋友就是为了找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed my friends just to get to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.11,0:36:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是这俩人冒出来我还能更早找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would've done it sooner if these two hadn't shown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.10,0:36:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不召唤我  我会出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call? I would've come.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我挺喜欢看你痛苦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I kinda liked watching you suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.25,0:36:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不仅是奥德丽最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't just Audrey's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.60,0:36:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.78,0:36:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她死后  萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after she died, Sully, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.58,0:36:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时最需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never needed you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.23,0:36:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奥德丽死时  我慌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I panicked when Audrey died,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.92,0:36:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我留下你自己面对痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I left you to deal with the pain
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.82,0:36:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不能接受这是我造成的惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I couldn't handle being the one that caused it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以也许我也夺走你的所爱  萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe I'll take something you love, Sully --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.03,0:36:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个真人\N{\fnArial\fs30}a real person.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.32,0:36:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别指望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.62,0:37:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我  会不会让你好受些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will killing me make you feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.35,0:37:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  萨利  这不是解决办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sully, that's not the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.01,0:37:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.80,0:37:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做对孩子最好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's best for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.77,0:37:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reesy...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.38,0:37:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这是你需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if this is what you need,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.99,0:37:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.18,0:37:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.03,0:37:28.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我停不下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.39,0:37:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是那么生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just still so mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.42,0:37:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reese.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.90,0:37:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me. Revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.44,0:37:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会让你好受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't gonna make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.72,0:37:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见过很多怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I have seen more than my share of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.86,0:37:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean real monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.17,0:37:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.03,0:38:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.67,0:38:04.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是《芝麻街》的泰瑞莎修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are Sesame Street Mother Teresas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.16,0:38:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不在我弟弟身边时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I wasn't there for my little brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.42,0:38:11.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨利在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sully was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.41,0:38:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说他没有犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I'm not saying that he didn't make a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.87,0:38:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你知道他绝不是什么怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you know that there is not a monstrous bone in his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.72,0:38:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.85,0:38:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞茜  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Reesy, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.79,0:39:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你知道了奥德丽的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Well, now that you know about Audrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.14,0:39:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能再也不想见到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you probably never wanna see me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.11,0:39:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever think...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.66,0:39:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你是我的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you're a hero to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.78,0:39:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -萨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Sully...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.44,0:39:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing I've learned --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.83,0:39:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英雄都不是完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heroes aren't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.91,0:39:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候  他们也会害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, they're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.70,0:39:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是因为  他们所面对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that just means the thing that they're facing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.76,0:39:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超级重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's super important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.65,0:39:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人其他人会去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nobody else is gonna go for it
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.17,0:39:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为其他人都没这胆量\N{\fnArial\fs30}because nobody else has got the balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.49,0:39:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又到了那个时刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it is that time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.86,0:40:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会去看着瑞茜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, um, you'll look in on Reese?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.09,0:40:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  我会去看她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I will be checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.80,0:40:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.55,0:40:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你帮我照看萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you for looking out for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.09,0:40:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not a germ at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.51,0:40:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.28,0:40:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你永远也别想让我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're not gonna ever get me to admit
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.95,0:40:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是最奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're not the weirdest thing out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.17,0:40:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是好的奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a good weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.60,0:40:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.79,0:40:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.14,0:40:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们需要认真讨论一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we need to seriously discuss
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.92,0:40:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去笼子的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}me going to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.69,0:40:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.90,0:41:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的  谈话愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not happening. Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.84,0:41:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  即使幻象是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, even if these visions are real --
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.06,0:41:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  是路西法  和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's Lucifer? And me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.44,0:41:16.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在笼子里  我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cage? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.05,0:41:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这个  我的心结\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this -- this lump in my throat...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.71,0:41:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不再是个借口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an excuse, not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.26,0:41:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.57,0:41:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  总有其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? There's always another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.99,0:41:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.34,0:41:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.81,0:41:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他办法是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the other way?

